sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant App as POS App
    participant Repo as Payment Repository
    participant DB as Encrypted Local Storage
    participant SDK as POS SDK
    participant GW as Payment Gateway
    User ->> App: Enter amount and start payment
    App ->> Repo: Create payment intent (amount, card)
    Repo ->> Repo: Generate intentId and idempotencyKey
    Repo ->> DB: Save payment intent (PENDING)
    Repo -->> App: Payment intent created (intentId)
    App ->> App: Navigate to card payment screen
    App ->> Repo: Start card payment (intentId)

    par Load intent state
        Repo ->> DB: Load payment intent (intentId)
        DB -->> Repo: Payment intent loaded<br>(includes idempotencyKey)
    and Read card
        Repo ->> SDK: Read card
        SDK -->> Repo: Card token / EMV data
    end

    Repo ->> GW: Charge payment (amount, idempotencyKey, card token)

    alt Success
        GW -->> Repo: Success (transactionId)
        Repo ->> DB: Update intent (COMPLETED, transactionId)
        Repo -->> App: Payment success

    else Failure (retryable=false)
        GW -->> Repo: Failure (error, retryable=false)
        Repo ->> DB: Update intent (FAILED, lastError=error)
        Repo -->> App: Payment failed

    else Failure (retryable=true)
        GW -->> Repo: Failure (error, retryable=true)
        Repo ->> DB: Update intent (PENDING, lastError=error)
        Repo -->> App: Payment retryable

    else Timeout / Network error
        GW --x Repo: No response
        Repo -->> App: Payment retryable
    end
